  "title": "http2: Human readable follow HTTP/2 headers",
  "description": "Make the headers in Follow HTTP/2 stream in the human readable\nformat, similar to HTTP 1.1\n\nAlso remove some of the non-readable flags from what is sent\nto the Follow tap from DATA frames.\n\nIf people want the non human readable information, they should\nuse Follow TLS or Follow TCP stream.\n\nFix #18239",
